      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty strong take. but i've read some stuff saying it actually helps by lowering prices on consumer goods and opening up new markets for US tech and services. isn't that also supposed to help the economy in the long run? why does it seem like the \"bad\" side is so much more definitive in your answer?",
