      "content": "i get that, but it feels like you're basically saying the \"pros\" are just minor perks while the \"cons\" are the only real impact. if i were writing my paper, i'd need to know if the economists who support it have a valid point, or if their arguments are just excuses for corporations. is there any actual evidence that the benefits for workers exist, or is it all just theory?",
